simulator lang=spectre insensitive=yes
inline subckt n_33_mm ( d g s b )
parameters w=0u l=0u
+ dtemp=0 nf=1 mf=1 mis_flag=1
+ nf_odd=nf-2*int(nf/2) nf_even=1-nf_odd
+ poly_to_cont=0.3e-06 cont_size=0.24e-06 cont_to_diff=0.1e-06
